          "reason": "Same transport, opposite permission posture: this session would refuse any ask it were shown. Neither posture reaches an ask, because bash refuses the command before either ask site, which is what makes the refusal a property of the transport failure rather than of the answer. See the allow row for why no admitted shape is reachable here."
        }
      }
